# @name: docker | Run Interactive Container
# @description: Runs a container interactively with a shell Group: Docker Container Management. Template: replace placeholders before running. {container_name} = Name for the container | {image_name} = Docker image to run | {command} = Command to execute (e.g., /bin/bash) [default "/bin/bash"]
docker run -it --name {container_name} {image_name} {command}